"\n"
"DRY RUN: nothing is written to the keyboard.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ZKUŠEBNÍ BĚH: do klávesnice se nic nezapisuje.\n"

#: apihub-app/crates/akmctl/src/devnamecmd.rs
